  <layout>One printed page. Title block centred at top (running title area, heading lines, subtitle in italic). Below it one main text column with a historiated initial A. Marginal notes in the right margin (side="right"), beside the text, including two "Pagina" notes and "Edit. primae" notes. Catchword "quam" at the lower right of the text.</layout>
